{"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"PushwooshNotificationUI provides ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — a drop-in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"UNNotificationContentExtension","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" view controller that renders an Instagram-style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stories experience: full-bleed images, top progress bars, auto-advance, tap-zone"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"navigation, per-frame title\/subtitle, and an optional deep-link button.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The module links only UIKit, UserNotifications, and UserNotificationsUI (plus","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"CryptoKit for a stable cache key), so it adds no Pushwoosh Core\/Framework weight","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"to your memory-constrained extension process."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Usage","anchor":"Usage","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In your Notification Content Extension:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import PushwooshNotificationUI","","class NotificationViewController: PushwooshStoriesViewController {}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then set these keys in the extension’s Info.plist:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"UNNotificationExtensionCategory","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" = "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PW_STORIES"},{"type":"text","text":" (must match "},{"code":"aps.category","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNNotificationExtensionUserInteractionEnabled"},{"type":"text","text":" = "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"YES"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNNotificationExtensionDefaultContentHidden"},{"type":"text","text":" = "},{"code":"YES","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"UNNotificationExtensionInitialContentSizeRatio","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" = e.g. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"1.5"},{"type":"text","text":" (keep in sync with "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController\/storyAspectRatio","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":")"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSExtensionPrincipalClass"},{"text":" = ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$(PRODUCT_MODULE_NAME).NotificationViewController"},{"type":"text","text":" (code-only, no storyboard)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"anchor":"Payload","level":2,"text":"Payload","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The stories are described by a "},{"code":"pw_stories","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" block, alongside an ","type":"text"},{"code":"aps.category","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"matching ","type":"text"},{"code":"UNNotificationExtensionCategory","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The parser accepts the block either at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"payload root"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (e.g. via the Pushwoosh API "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ios_root_params"},{"text":") or inside the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"custom-data container ","type":"text"},{"code":"u","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":"userdata","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (the Pushwoosh API ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"data"},{"text":" field — delivered as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"a dictionary or a JSON-encoded string). The root form on the device looks like this:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["{","  \"aps\": { \"category\": \"PW_STORIES\" },","  \"pw_stories\": { \"pages\": [","    { \"image\": \"https:\/\/...\/1.jpg\", \"duration\": 5.0,","      \"link\": \"myapp:\/\/sale\", \"button_title\": \"Buy\",","      \"title\": \"Summer Sale\", \"subtitle\": \"Up to 70% off\" },","    { \"image\": \"https:\/\/...\/2.jpg\" }","  ]}","}"],"syntax":"json"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sent through the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"data"},{"type":"text","text":" API field instead (recommended, since it does not depend on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ios_root_params"},{"text":"), the same block arrives nested under ","type":"text"},{"code":"u","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — while "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"aps.category"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"(and "},{"code":"mutable-content","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for the pre-cache path) still go through "},{"code":"ios_root_params.aps","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"as there is no dedicated request field for them. The relevant createMessage fields:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["{","  \"ios_root_params\": { \"aps\": { \"category\": \"PW_STORIES\", \"mutable-content\": 1 } },","  \"data\": { \"pw_stories\": { \"pages\": [ { \"image\": \"https:\/\/...\/1.jpg\" } ] } }","}"],"syntax":"json"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The parser tries the root first, then "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"u"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"userdata"},{"text":", so both delivery styles work","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and old pushes keep rendering."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Every field except ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"image"},{"type":"text","text":" is optional. "},{"code":"link","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (like "},{"code":"image","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") must include a URL"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scheme. A missing, empty, or malformed payload falls back to the default content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"(the alert body) without crashing — override ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController\/showDefaultContent(for:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"anchor":"Analytics","level":2,"text":"Analytics","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Set ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController\/storiesDelegate","isActive":true},{"text":" to observe lifecycle and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"engagement and forward it to your analytics (the module itself sends nothing):","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["class NotificationViewController: PushwooshStoriesViewController, PushwooshStoriesDelegate {","    override func viewDidLoad() {","        super.viewDidLoad()","        storiesDelegate = self","    }","    func storiesViewController(_ c: PushwooshStoriesViewController, didTapActionFor page: StoryPage, at index: Int) {","        \/\/ forward the per-page click to your backend","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Instant--offline-first-frame-App-Group-pre-cache","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Instant \/ offline first frame (App Group pre-cache)"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To make the first frame appear instantly (and offline), pre-download the media in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a Notification ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Service","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" Extension into a shared App Group container that the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Content Extension reads from:"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Enable the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"App Groups"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" capability (same id) on both the Service and Content"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"extensions, and override "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController\/appGroupIdentifier"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"From the Service Extension’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"didReceive(_:withContentHandler:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", call","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesMediaPrefetcher\/prefetch(userInfo:appGroupIdentifier:completion:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Send the push with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"mutable-content: 1"},{"text":" so the Service Extension runs.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Without this, the module still works — images download on display instead.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,